{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your family's company just bought a bunch of fledgling AAA game studios, and <strong>you're</strong> the nepo baby who has to turn them into profit for the shareholders. Can you make great games and hype up the public? Depends on your ability to hire and fire your way to quarterly profit goals! Mess up, and you're out - you'll just have to dust yourself off, call in some favors, and try your luck at the next studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make Profit to Please The Board</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only goal is to satisfy &quot;The Board&quot; of your parent company so you don\u2019t get fired. If you can\u2019t meet their quarterly profit goal, your run is over! Make it  8 quarters to secure your studio's financial success - and then see what else The Board has in store for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/the_board.png?t=1749199044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Consult Experts to Get Multipliers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your personal network comprises 150 experts who are the best of the best, and you can unlock more each run. Each one has special abilities that add multipliers to stats like sales, worker productivity, and hype.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/patriarch.png?t=1749199044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100 studio upgrades let you fine tune your departments and give synergies to your Experts. If you think your studio's looking a bit drab and boring, just invest a few million dollars and see what happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/statue_upgrade.png?t=1749199044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't control the games media, but you can control how you react to them. You get to decide whether each random event merits a hiring or firing, which results in unique consequences. Just be careful\u2014your decisions could lead to other events being added to the pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/a_tiny_note.png?t=1749199044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use Consumables Strategically</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 different Favors let you buff certain employees by their department or individually. Manipulate your odds of success with a well-timed purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/extras/new_consumables.png?t=1749199044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lose Everything and Start Again</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eventually, you won't be able to keep up with the cycle of infinite profit\u2014that's just the game industry for you! But don't fret, you'll be able to take your golden parachute and get back on your feet in no time. Your next studio awaits, and the network of experts you've unlocked will be there right alongside you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358040?t=1749199044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358040?t=1749199044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/95f1c861547116fbd9e420b3a7cdbbd718d6900e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749199044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/95f1c861547116fbd9e420b3a7cdbbd718d6900e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749199044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3690350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your family's company just bought a bunch of fledgling AAA game studios, and <strong>you're</strong> the nepo baby who has to turn them into profit for the shareholders. Can you make great games and hype up the public? Depends on your ability to hire and fire your way to quarterly profit goals! Mess up, and you're out - you'll just have to dust yourself off, call in some favors, and try your luck at the next studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make Profit to Please The Board</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only goal is to satisfy &quot;The Board&quot; of your parent company so you don\u2019t get fired. If you can\u2019t meet their quarterly profit goal, your run is over! Make it  8 quarters to secure your studio's financial success - and then see what else The Board has in store for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a